{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-39","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：棱柱与平行四边形与平行线","englishTitle":"If there be two prisms of equal height, and one have a parallelogram as base and the other a triangle, and if the parallelogram be double of the triangle, the prisms will be equal.","book":11,"number":39,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.39","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.39/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":39,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-39@raw-eaeaabc315980e19","contentId":"euclid-11-39","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eaeaabc315980e192f2721b0bd356941d4758737faa5152a9415c57127bd3865","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-39.statement","euclid-11-39.construction.1","euclid-11-39.construction.2","euclid-11-39.proof.1","euclid-11-39.proof.2","euclid-11-39.proof.3","euclid-11-39.conclusion","euclid-11-39.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-39.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-39","revisionId":"euclid-11-39@raw-eaeaabc315980e19","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a8b549b064f444c08bfa609aa5d744bfe7ccc10caef4939dd662aee3f0d2d84c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If there be two prisms of equal height, and one have a parallelogram as base and the other a triangle, and if the parallelogram be double of the triangle, the prisms will be equal."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两面的高度相等, 一个是平行四边形, 底边, 另一个是三角, 如果平行四边形是三角的两倍, 棱镜将是相等的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-39.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-39","revisionId":"euclid-11-39@raw-eaeaabc315980e19","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e83d0edc0f05267b63dd2e62bf1ddd4ef9f78878c28142d28cbcfeee6fecf02","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCDEF, GHKLMN be two prisms of equal height, let one have the parallelogram AF as base, and the other the triangle GHK, and let the parallelogram AF be double of the triangle GHK; I say that the prism ABCDEF is equal to the prism GHKLMN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCDEF,GHKLMN 成为两面相等的棱镜,让一个平行四边形 AF是底边,另一个三角GHK, 让平行四边形 AF是三角GHK的两倍; 我说ABCDEF 和GHKLMN 相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-39.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-39","revisionId":"euclid-11-39@raw-eaeaabc315980e19","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"73a1c644c418a30445b12521a24c209fc414cc050b2047e2077ab7d17f82eaf3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the solids AO, GP be completed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AO,GP的固体完成"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-39.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-39","revisionId":"euclid-11-39@raw-eaeaabc315980e19","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2b93b7a1a61ef3f7ece898259ac1d7e8c0f0e686fb109d5a0b39a1700e97dea6","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since the parallelogram AF is double of the triangle GHK, while the parallelogram HK is also double of the triangle GHK, [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] therefore the parallelogram AF is equal to the parallelogram HK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于平行四边形 AF是三角形GHK的两倍,而平行四边形 HK也是三角形GHK的两倍,因此平行四边形 AF等于平行四边形 HK。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-39.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-39","revisionId":"euclid-11-39@raw-eaeaabc315980e19","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12ccdc13c05ed71a5a21a3a9fae3353f1425f36f27e7dd452dc8ec63202d37a4","citations":["euclid-11-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But parallelepipedal solids which are on equal bases and of the same height are equal to one another; [[XI. 31](/principles/euclid-11-31)] therefore the solid AO is equal to the solid GP."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,在底边和同一高度的平行管道固体是等量的;因此,AO固体等于GP固体。 [[XI. 31](/principles/euclid-11-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-39.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-39","revisionId":"euclid-11-39@raw-eaeaabc315980e19","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"667d9e2e89c887f1a84d5f0a3999ecda103b11131e60c04c85d7b37d829ce1f4","citations":["euclid-11-28"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the prism ABCDEF is half of the solid AO, and the prism GHKLMN is half of the solid GP; [[XI. 28](/principles/euclid-11-28)] therefore the prism ABCDEF is equal to the prism GHKLMN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"棱镜ABCDEF是AO固体的一半,GHKLMN是GP固体的一半;因此棱镜ABCDEF等于GHKLMN。 [[XI. 28](/principles/euclid-11-28)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-39.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-39","revisionId":"euclid-11-39@raw-eaeaabc315980e19","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-39.source","contentId":"euclid-11-39","revisionId":"euclid-11-39@raw-eaeaabc315980e19","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"59cf4d07598afbeac70aab9a88b0842653d6f09ae5fdc88004a755e083de5407","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.39/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.39\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-39:euclid-1-34:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-39","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-39.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-34","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.39","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.39/","sourceLabel":"I. 34"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-39:euclid-11-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-39","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-39.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.39","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.39/","sourceLabel":"XI. 31"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-39:euclid-11-28:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-39","sourceBlockIds":["eucl